    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\nrebeltaz@RobotsAndComputers.com\n\n### qTox Version\n\n1.18.2\n\n### Commit Hash\n\nac1a16ec0bb7ef1f9bbd494a076e661b05937d08\n\n### Toxcore Version\n\n0.2.20\n\n### Qt Version\n\n6.8.1\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start qTox\n2. click on New Profile\n\n### Observed Behavior\n\nThe Load Profile window looks fine, but on the New Profile window, the textboxes are missing the labels. I have NO idea what data goes where. \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fcbf3acc-c2f0-46bf-a258-564e2668a058)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b45668d0-43e6-48b1-a98a-1ede3ca49e40)\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nI would expect the textboxes to be labeled as to real name, username, password, etc... \n\n### Reproducibility\n\nAlways\n\n### Operating System\n\nLinux\n\n### Operating System version/distro/name/etc.\n\nUbuntu 22.04 LTS\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\n\n```",
